#: ../../source/async_README.md:14
msgid ""
"Async is a utility module which provides straight-forward, powerful "
"functions for working with [asynchronous "
"JavaScript](http://caolan.github.io/async/v3/global.html). Although "
"originally designed for use with [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) and "
"installable via `npm i async`, it can also be used directly in the "
"browser.  An ESM/MJS version is included in the main `async` package that"
" should automatically be used with compatible bundlers such as Webpack "
"and Rollup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/async_README.md:16
msgid ""
